{"id":"nuevamente","lemma":"nuevamente","pos":"adv","rank":1774,"glosses":["newly","again"],"ipa":"/ˌnwebaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-nuevamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"No me dejes nuevamente.","en":"Don't leave me again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455123","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},null]},{"text":"Me gustaría ser joven nuevamente.","en":"I'd like to be young again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519099","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"young, youthful"},null]},{"text":"La vi nuevamente.","en":"I saw her again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441687","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null]},{"text":"Esperamos verlos nuevamente.","en":"We hope to meet you again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512007","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null]},{"text":"¡Gracias nuevamente!","en":"Thanks again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439185","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},null]}]}